   {
    "x": 190,
    "y": 975,
    "rotation": 0,
    "id": 117,
    "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.round_rectangle",
    "width": 540,
    "height": 270,
    "lockAspectRatio": false,
    "lockShape": false,
    "order": 117,
    "graphic": {
     "type": "Shape",
     "Shape": {
      "tid": "com.gliffy.stencil.round_rectangle.basic_v1",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#C9AE3E",
      "fillColor": "#FCF4D6",
      "dashStyle": null,
      "gradient": false,
      "dropShadow": false,
      "state": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "shadowX": 0,
      "shadowY": 0
     }
    },
    "children": [
     {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 2,
      "rotation": 0,
      "id": 118,
      "uid": null,
      "width": 536,
      "height": 266,
      "lockAspectRatio": false,
      "lockShape": false,
      "order": 118,
      "graphic": {
       "type": "Text",
       "Text": {
        "overflow": "none",
        "paddingTop": 6,
        "paddingRight": 6,
        "paddingBottom": 6,
        "paddingLeft": 6,
        "outerPaddingTop": 6,
        "outerPaddingRight": 6,
        "outerPaddingBottom": 2,
        "outerPaddingLeft": 6,
        "type": "fixed",
        "lineTValue": null,
        "linePerpValue": null,
        "cardinalityType": null,
        "html": "<p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A2A33;line-height:1.3;\">The drain is incomplete</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">Renaming live.txt takes BCC out of the <b>BOS</b> Akamai GTM only. The <b>API</b> GTM checks TCP:443 against APIC, which is untouched, so it keeps assigning half of all new /api/cdb sessions to APIC-BCC.</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">If you renamed live.txt in order to patch BCC, you have not taken BCC out of the API path at the edge at all.</span></p>",
        "tid": null,
        "valign": "top",
        "vposition": "none",
        "hposition": "none"
       }
      },
      "children": []
     }
    ],
    "linkMap": []
   },
   {
    "x": 750,
    "y": 975,
    "rotation": 0,
    "id": 119,
    "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.round_rectangle",
    "width": 540,
    "height": 270,
    "lockAspectRatio": false,
    "lockShape": false,
    "order": 119,
    "graphic": {
     "type": "Shape",
     "Shape": {
      "tid": "com.gliffy.stencil.round_rectangle.basic_v1",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#C9AE3E",
      "fillColor": "#FCF4D6",
      "dashStyle": null,
      "gradient": false,
      "dropShadow": false,
      "state": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "shadowX": 0,
      "shadowY": 0
     }
    },
    "children": [
     {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 2,
      "rotation": 0,
      "id": 120,
      "uid": null,
      "width": 536,
      "height": 266,
      "lockAspectRatio": false,
      "lockShape": false,
      "order": 120,
      "graphic": {
       "type": "Text",
       "Text": {
        "overflow": "none",
        "paddingTop": 6,
        "paddingRight": 6,
        "paddingBottom": 6,
        "paddingLeft": 6,
        "outerPaddingTop": 6,
        "outerPaddingRight": 6,
        "outerPaddingBottom": 2,
        "outerPaddingLeft": 6,
        "type": "fixed",
        "lineTValue": null,
        "linePerpValue": null,
        "cardinalityType": null,
        "html": "<p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A2A33;line-height:1.3;\">Lane 2 is the DACT-104 fork</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">The pinned target is the F5 LTM VIP itself. Whether an existing /banking session survives depends entirely on what the F5 pool monitor checks.</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">TCP &rarr; BCC keeps serving and sessions bleed out naturally, which is what you want before a patch.</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">live.txt &rarr; no available pool members, pinned requests refused. One file, two control systems.</span></p>",
        "tid": null,
        "valign": "top",
        "vposition": "none",
        "hposition": "none"
       }
      },
      "children": []
     }
    ],
    "linkMap": []
   },
   {
    "x": 1310,
    "y": 975,
    "rotation": 0,
    "id": 121,
    "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.round_rectangle",
    "width": 540,
    "height": 270,
    "lockAspectRatio": false,
    "lockShape": false,
    "order": 121,
    "graphic": {
     "type": "Shape",
     "Shape": {
      "tid": "com.gliffy.stencil.round_rectangle.basic_v1",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#C25450",
      "fillColor": "#F9DBDA",
      "dashStyle": null,
      "gradient": false,
      "dropShadow": false,
      "state": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "shadowX": 0,
      "shadowY": 0
     }
    },
    "children": [
     {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 2,
      "rotation": 0,
      "id": 122,
      "uid": null,
      "width": 536,
      "height": 266,
      "lockAspectRatio": false,
      "lockShape": false,
      "order": 122,
      "graphic": {
       "type": "Text",
       "Text": {
        "overflow": "none",
        "paddingTop": 6,
        "paddingRight": 6,
        "paddingBottom": 6,
        "paddingLeft": 6,
        "outerPaddingTop": 6,
        "outerPaddingRight": 6,
        "outerPaddingBottom": 2,
        "outerPaddingLeft": 6,
        "type": "fixed",
        "lineTValue": null,
        "linePerpValue": null,
        "cardinalityType": null,
        "html": "<p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A2A33;line-height:1.3;\">Lane 4 breaks regardless</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">Stage 6 is DNS. It cannot see a cookie or a JSESSIONID, so it moves every request on APIC-BCC to SCC BOS, existing sessions included.</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">There is also a convergence window: until APIC re-resolves it keeps sending to the BCC LTM, which may already have no live members.</span></p><p style='text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#4A5B66;line-height:1.3;\">No DNS-layer design can bleed. Fixing this means moving the BOS site decision into APIC.</span></p>",
        "tid": null,
        "valign": "top",
        "vposition": "none",
        "hposition": "none"
       }
      },
      "children": []
     }
    ],
    "linkMap": []
   }
  ]
 }
}